{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1792248115,"nonce":"aVhI6ex5Ac5RP5nUDOcfTrkqncI=","message":"Progress 2026-10-17, after Ash c0047e66 (libm):\n- blinc_abi.wasm links and loads in a page. A tiny program creating a layout tree and laying out a box runs in headless Chrome; ashui's smoke test runs there too, 142 of its 353 checks before it stops. Its four failures and the stop (a null access in the canvas CJK text check) are all missing fonts: a page has none. A bundled font fixes that: PageSmoke measures text in a bundled face to the pixel in the page.\n- Found two Ash loader bugs, sent to ash-7d. (1) Both loaders (native/dylink.rs, browser/dylink.rs) fill GOT.mem entries with the exported data global's raw value, which is relative to __memory_base; every static reached through the GOT is read at the wrong address, so Signal.set traps in blinc_core's notifier (std's Once uses 0 for COMPLETE, so a zeroed address looks installed). Worked around by linking with -Bsymbolic, which removes the module's GOT.func imports (324) and all but one GOT.mem import (58); the loaders should still add the base. (2) The wasmtime host (ash run) fails a side module's WASI import with 'missing required memory export'; the browser host is fine, so the lane runs in Chrome.\n- Fonts: hl_blinc_font_register in blinc_abi (its issue 477808515ad825362f2988c55ed3b4a0eea1a61a2bde57052c35954c9df25d12) and ashui.text.Fonts (embed, load, register). blinc_text caches a failed lookup of a family name and cannot clear it, so fonts must be registered before text is laid out in their family. Generic families need a bundled face from blinc_text's fallback list (Roboto, Noto Sans or DejaVu Sans for sans-serif; JetBrains Mono or Fira Code for monospace).\n- tests/wasm/run.sh builds the module and a program, has Ash build it for a page and runs it in headless Chrome through tests/wasm/run_page.mjs.\nStill open: Ash's two loader fixes, the Haxe-side guards for file reads, WindowedApp on xwindow.wasm and xgpu.wasm in a page, and which real fonts the showcase bundles.","files":null}]}